        "conditionKey": "offensiveDirectiveOwnAtk",
        "source": "avatar_10000137",
        "description": "Offensive Directive, SELF half (not in Radiance): after the Mortar, Valeriy's own Electro hits (skill, burst, Thunderburst Shells) gain flat DMG = 51.68% of his ATK + A4 0.3% of his ATK per Impact Momentum the Mortar consumed, read live from his own ATK via electro_dmgIncFromAtk_. Pick the Momentum consumed. The Radiance half only buffs Stellar-Conduct DMG, which Valeriy does not deal. Offensive Directive is 15 stacks for 18s and each Electro instance consumes one (one per opponent hit) -- the pool is not enforced, so split the rotation with per-target bonusStats if it has more instances than stacks. The Mortar that grants the stacks does not consume one.",
